{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Eggo&quot; - Your Cyber Family Companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hatch Your Eggo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adopt an egg and hatch Eggo, a tiny trash-collecting critter!\u00a0It is both a treasure hunter and a budding inventor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/\u86cb\u7834\u788e1.gif?t=1746952581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Care</strong> <strong>&amp; Grow!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under your loving attention, Eggo grows bit by bit.\u00a0It journeys during the day and returns home to sleep at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/\u5e7c\u5e74\u671f\u7761\u89c91.gif?t=1746952581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel &amp; Scavenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch Eggo travel in your screen's corner, gathering odd treasures in its tiny backpack to craft unique looks. This little genius turns junk into gold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/walk.gif?t=1746952581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get married &amp; Lay eggs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed, clean, and marry friends' Eggos to breed hybrid babies bursting with secret genes\u2014team up for ultra-rare offspring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/\u4e24\u4e2a\u827e\u679c\u9760\u8fd1.gif?t=1746952581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700760?t=1746952581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s